SUMMARY:Due 23:59: BIEN 210: Team presentation slides due
DESCRIPTION:Time: 23:59\n\nPowerPoint named Topic_Group#_B210_TP. 15 points
  team\, 15 individual. Talk is 20 minutes plus 5 minutes of questions wher
 e every member must answer. Expected outline: introduction\, problem state
 ment\, literature review\, hypothesis (specific\, testable\, novel)\, prop
 osed approach using course concepts\, expected results\, impact and future
  work\, conclusion.\n\nWorth 30% of the course grade.\n\nSource: Outline p
 .5 and p.6; myCourses announcement Oct 27
END:VEVENT
